#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:6
msgid "UART Sample"
msgstr "UART 示例"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:10
msgid ""
"The `uart_demo` sample demonstrates the UART driver's echo functionality:"
" receiving data and sending it back as-is."
msgstr "`uart_demo` 示例演示了 UART 驱动的回显功能：接收数据并将其原样发送回去。"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:12
msgid "Features Demonstrated"
msgstr "功能演示"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:14
msgid ""
"Manual UART configuration using `tlk_uart_configure` and "
"`tlk_uart_configure_pinmux` (when `CONFIG_TLK_UART_USED_AUTO_CONFIG` is "
"disabled)"
msgstr "使用 `tlk_uart_configure` 和 `tlk_uart_configure_pinmux` 手动配置 UART（当 `CONFIG_TLK_UART_USED_AUTO_CONFIG` 禁用时）"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:15
msgid ""
"Manual UART flow control configuration using "
"`tlk_uart_configure_flow_control` and "
"`tlk_uart_configure_flow_control_pinmux` if "
"`CONFIG_TLK_UART1_FLOW_CONTROL` is enabled"
msgstr "如果启用了 `CONFIG_TLK_UART1_FLOW_CONTROL`，使用 `tlk_uart_configure_flow_control` 和 `tlk_uart_configure_flow_control_pinmux` 手动配置 UART 流控制"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:16
msgid "Callback-based data reception (`tlk_uart_receive_bytes`)"
msgstr "基于回调的数据接收（`tlk_uart_receive_bytes`）"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:17
msgid "Data transmission (`tlk_uart_send_bytes`)"
msgstr "数据传输（`tlk_uart_send_bytes`）"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:18
msgid "Power management and sleep prevention (optional)"
msgstr "电源管理和睡眠防止（可选）"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:20
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:22
msgid "Initialization"
msgstr "初始化"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:24
msgid ""
"**Manual Configuration** — If `CONFIG_TLK_UART_USED_AUTO_CONFIG` is "
"disabled, manually configure UART1 parameters using `tlk_uart_configure` "
"and `tlk_uart_configure_pinmux`. If `CONFIG_TLK_UART1_FLOW_CONTROL` is "
"enabled, also configure flow control using "
"`tlk_uart_configure_flow_control` and "
"`tlk_uart_configure_flow_control_pinmux`."
msgstr ""
"**手动配置** — 如果禁用了 `CONFIG_TLK_UART_USED_AUTO_CONFIG`，使用 `tlk_uart_configure` 和 `tlk_uart_configure_pinmux` 手动配置 UART1 参数。如果启用了 `CONFIG_TLK_UART1_FLOW_CONTROL`，还需使用 `tlk_uart_configure_flow_control` 和 `tlk_uart_configure_flow_control_pinmux` 配置流控制。"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:25
msgid ""
"**Power Management Test** — If `CONFIG_TLK_UART_DEMO_SLEEP` is enabled, "
"first print \"Before sleep\", sleep for 2 seconds, then print \"After "
"sleep\" upon wake-up"
msgstr "**电源管理测试** — 如果启用了 `CONFIG_TLK_UART_DEMO_SLEEP`，先打印 \"Before sleep\"，睡眠 2 秒，唤醒后打印 \"After sleep\""

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:26
msgid ""
"**Interrupt Enable** — Call `tlk_core_interrupt_enable()` to enable "
"asynchronous callbacks"
msgstr "**中断启用** — 调用 `tlk_core_interrupt_enable()` 启用异步回调"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:28
msgid "Main Loop (Echo Flow)"
msgstr "主循环（回显流程）"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:30
msgid "Call `tlk_uart_receive_bytes` to listen for data"
msgstr "调用 `tlk_uart_receive_bytes` 监听数据"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:31
msgid "Wait for the `rx_handler` callback to set the `rx_done` flag"
msgstr "等待 `rx_handler` 回调设置 `rx_done` 标志"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:32
msgid "Send received data back to the serial port (`tlk_uart_send_bytes`)"
msgstr "将接收到的数据发送回串口（`tlk_uart_send_bytes`）"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:33
msgid "Reset the flag and repeat"
msgstr "重置标志并重复"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:35
msgid "Sleep Prevention Test"
msgstr "睡眠防止测试"

#: ../../source/samples/uart.md:37
msgid ""
"When `CONFIG_TLK_UART_DEMO_PREVENT` is enabled, the sample attempts to "
"sleep during reception to verify that `tlk_pm_sleep` returns "
"`TLK_PM_SLEEP_DENIED`."
msgstr "当启用 `CONFIG_TLK_UART_DEMO_PREVENT` 时，示例尝试在接收期间睡眠，以验证 `tlk_pm_sleep` 返回 `TLK_PM_SLEEP_DENIED`。"

